# Artificial Evolution changes Walls to Constructs in Bog Rats' text (CR 612.1); a Wall can block it, a Construct cannot.
[Bot1 Deck]
Bog Rats
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Artificial Evolution
Memnite
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Wall of Wood
Forest
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bog Rats.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Wood.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Bog Rats)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Wall)
Bot1.Modes(Construct)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Bog Rats > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Bog Rats)
Bot2.Block(Wall of Wood > Bog Rats; Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Artificial Evolution
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood.Toughness = 3
Bot2.Life = 20
